---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — CalcBox"
  description="Read the official CalcBox Privacy Policy. Learn how we protect your privacy with 100% client-side calculations and zero data harvesting."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Transparency & Security</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm text-gray-700 space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          At CalcBox ("we", "our", or "us"), accessible from <a href="https://calcbox.siyamxe.workers.dev" class="text-indigo-600 underline">https://calcbox.siyamxe.workers.dev</a>, we consider the privacy of our visitors to be of paramount importance. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information that is collected and recorded by CalcBox and how we use it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">2. Client-Side Calculations (Zero Data Harvesting)</h2>
        <p>
          CalcBox operates primarily as a client-side web application. When you input numeric values into any of our calculators (such as loan amounts, interest rates, weight, height, or percentages), all mathematical computations are processed directly inside your web browser using client-side JavaScript.
        </p>
        <p class="p-4 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-900 rounded-xl text-sm border border-emerald-100">
          <strong>Important:</strong> Your numerical entries and calculation results are never sent across the internet to our servers or any third-party databases. When you close or refresh the page, your input data is immediately erased from memory.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">3. Log Files and Web Hosting</h2>
        <p>
          Like most modern websites, CalcBox is hosted on secure global content delivery networks (Cloudflare). These services may automatically collect standard non-identifying server log information such as Internet Protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date/time stamps, and referring/exit pages. This information is purely used for detecting DDoS attacks, maintaining uptime, and optimizing infrastructure.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">4. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
        <p>
          CalcBox itself does not set tracking cookies or require user accounts. We do not use persistent identifiers to track your activity across other websites.
        </p>
        <p>
          In the future, third-party service providers (such as Google AdSense or Google Analytics) may serve cookies or web beacons to understand traffic patterns and serve relevant advertisements. You can choose to disable cookies through your individual browser options.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">5. Third-Party Advertising Partners</h2>
        <p>
          Some third-party ad networks use technology like cookies, JavaScript, or Web Beacons that are sent directly to your browser when advertisements appear on our site. They automatically receive your IP address when this occurs. These technologies are used to measure the effectiveness of their advertising campaigns and/or to personalize advertising content.
        </p>
        <p>
          CalcBox has no access to or control over these cookies that are used by third-party advertisers. We encourage you to consult the respective Privacy Policies of these third-party ad servers for more detailed information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">6. GDPR and CCPA Data Protection Rights</h2>
        <p>
          We want to make sure you are fully aware of all of your data protection rights. Because we do not collect, store, or sell personal identifiers or user databases, your privacy is safeguarded by default. If you ever submit an inquiry through our contact form, your provided email address is solely used to respond to your request.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or suggestions about our Privacy Policy, please do not hesitate to contact us at our <a href="/contact" class="text-indigo-600 underline">Contact Page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
